*Receiving <<<Authentication>>> as a direct parameter

  The <<<Authentication>>> object from the <<<SecurityContext>>> is also available as a plain method
  parameter — no annotation required.  OfficeFloor recognises it by type and supplies it automatically:

%{snippet|file=${basedir}/src/main/resources/officefloor/rest/security/auth.GET.yml|ignoreDownloadError=false}

